#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:5
#: ae5c61c1ea97446eaafb26dda1fc0631
msgid "Mocking an Airspeed Sensor for Bench Testing"
msgstr "用于台架测试的空速传感器模拟"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:7
#: e965bf35c8b64a7d8e5c90078faa54f5
msgid ""
"This article explains how you can use a potentiometer with an autopilot in "
"order to simulate the input from an Airspeed Sensor. This is very useful for"
" ground testing."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用电位器与飞控配合，以模拟空速传感器的输入。这对地面测试非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:12
#: 53eeb6c064754e32a164a58c9b2d7410
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:14
#: 9b9d50a5c0184f3a99d948a0c28ce820
msgid ""
"If your aerodynamic surfaces (i.e. auto flaps, ailerons, elevators, elevons,"
" etc.) are geared or actuated with airspeed, it may be helpful to ground "
"test them on your aircraft by sending the autopilot a specific airspeed."
msgstr ""
"如果您的气动舵面（即自动襟翼、副翼、升降舵、升降副翼等）通过空速驱动或致动，在飞机上进行地面测试时，通过向飞控发送特定空速来测试它们可能会有帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:19
#: 3162fbc444ae4aab94d7e9e96444ccd9
msgid ""
"To do this you must apply a voltage to an analog input pin designated as the"
" analog airspeed input. On a Pixhawk you can plug a potentiometer into ADC "
"6.6v (pin 15) or ADC 3.3v (pin 11). If you are using an I2C :ref:`airpseed "
"<airspeed>` sensor you will temporarily configure your autopilot to use the "
"analogue port."
msgstr ""
"为此，必须向指定为模拟空速输入的模拟输入引脚施加电压。在 Pixhawk 上，可以将电位器插入 ADC 6.6v（引脚 15）或 ADC 3.3v（引脚"
" 11）。如果您使用的是 I2C :ref:`airpseed <airspeed>` 传感器，需要临时将飞控配置为使用模拟端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:33
#: 3c617dcdbb024fd19147016478860906
msgid "Required parts"
msgstr "所需零件"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:35
#: 05c7eca673054b53add464aa8d01e6f6
msgid ""
"You will need a DF-13 cable and a simple `potentiometer like this "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9939>`__ or `this "
"<http://hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__39510__Potentiameter_Round_Pot_Turnigy_9XR_Transmitter_3set_.html>`__."
" Either a B10K and B5K potentiometer can be used to set speed from 0 to as "
"much as 90 m/s."
msgstr ""
"您将需要一根 DF-13 电缆和一个简单的 `电位器，如此 <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/9939>`__ 或 "
"`此 "
"<http://hobbyking.com/hobbyking/store/__39510__Potentiameter_Round_Pot_Turnigy_9XR_Transmitter_3set_.html>`__。B10K"
" 或 B5K 电位器均可用于将速度从 0 设置到最高 90 m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:39
#: 8d952d75c2ed4a928a0adf3f9f91536c
msgid "Pixhawk Configuration and Settings"
msgstr "Pixhawk 配置与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:41
#: 3431f75b312643219c301534a292813d
msgid ""
"Once the DF 13 cable is connected to the potentiometer, plug it into the "
":ref:`ADC 6.6v port <common-pixhawk-overview_pixhawk_analog_input_pins>`. "
"Open your Ground Control Station (GCS) of choice, and change the "
"``ARSPD_PIN`` parameter to Pin \"**15\"** as shown below."
msgstr ""
"将 DF 13 电缆连接到电位器后，将其插入 :ref:`ADC 6.6v 端口 <common-pixhawk-"
"overview_pixhawk_analog_input_pins>`。打开您选择的地面控制站（GCS），将 ``ARSPD_PIN`` "
"参数更改为引脚 「**15**」，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:49
#: de077546c3844a9bb3891b73877ac6b5
msgid ""
"Reboot your Pixhawk to allow this parameter change to have an effect. "
"Airspeed will reset to 1-3 m/s after the restart and initialization is "
"complete. Adjust the pot to set your desired speed."
msgstr "重启 Pixhawk 以使此参数更改生效。重启和初始化完成后，空速将重置为 1-3 m/s。调整电位器以设置所需速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/mocking-an-airspeed-sensor-for-bench-testing.rst:55
#: 2280cab63e004fdea5a6d5e176a4c982
msgid ""
"If you are using an I2C airspeed sensor - *remember to re-enable it!* Set "
"the ``ARSPD_PIN`` parameter to 65, and cycle the autopilot power to ensure "
"the I2C airspeed properly initializes. Check you get the normal 1-3 m/s "
"noise on the airspeed display."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是 I2C 空速传感器——*记得重新启用它！* 将 ``ARSPD_PIN`` 参数设为 65，并重启飞控电源以确保 I2C "
"空速正常初始化。检查空速显示是否恢复正常的 1-3 m/s 噪声。"
